cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Reproduction of the calculations in Colquhoun & Lape (2012),
  Allosteric coupling in ligand-gated ion channels
message: >-
  If you use this reproduction, please cite both the original paper and this
  repository.
type: software
version: 1.0.1
date-released: '2026-09-11'
# The concept DOI, which always resolves to the most recent version.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21916702
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21916703
    description: >-
      The archived v1.0.0 release: the code and outputs exactly as they were
      when the corrigendum was first submitted. v1.0.1 differs from it only by
      a note in the front matter recording that the notebook was drafted with
      the assistance of a large language model; no calculation, output or
      figure changed. The corrigendum should cite whichever of the two carries
      the wording the journal has accepted.
authors:
  - family-names: Lape
    given-names: Remigijus
  - family-names: Colquhoun
    given-names: David
abstract: >-
  A Jupyter notebook that recomputes, from the published rate constants, every
  number and calculated figure in Colquhoun & Lape (2012): Figs. 6, 7 and 8,
  Table 1, and the quantities quoted in the running text. Accompanies a
  corrigendum correcting two interchanged traces in Fig. 6 B and recording that
  the calculations were made from a single dataset rather than from the averaged
  rate constants of Fig. 3.
keywords:
  - ion channels
  - single-channel kinetics
  - Q-matrix
  - glycine receptor
  - flip mechanism
  - reproducibility
license: GPL-2.0-only
repository-code: 'https://github.com/DCPROGS/ColquhounLape2012-reproduction'
references:
  - type: article
    authors:
      - family-names: Colquhoun
        given-names: David
      - family-names: Lape
        given-names: Remigijus
    title: Allosteric coupling in ligand-gated ion channels
    journal: Journal of General Physiology
    volume: 140
    issue: 6
    start: 599
    end: 612
    year: 2012
    doi: 10.1085/jgp.201210844
  - type: software
    title: SCALCS
    version: v0.5.1-cl2012
    repository-code: 'https://github.com/DCPROGS/SCALCS'
